WEBVTT

1
00:00:06.258 --> 00:00:17.647
"What are you talking about, Zann?"

2
00:00:17.847 --> 00:00:18.628
Perda demanded.

3
00:00:19.408 --> 00:00:21.630
"How could Ello send you a Red Share?

4
00:00:22.151 --> 00:00:25.053
He's not a Red—he's not even from Magica!"

5
00:00:25.974 --> 00:00:28.676
Zann could hardly hear her over the noise of the rally.

6
00:00:28.696 --> 00:00:30.858
"Let's go back to my house!"

7
00:00:31.118 --> 00:00:31.578
he shouted.

8
00:00:32.018 --> 00:00:32.959
He grabbed his friends.

9
00:00:32.979 --> 00:00:37.689
"Zap!" Zann's house was a mess from the party.

10
00:00:38.529 --> 00:00:42.771
When the kids arrived, Zing was standing on a table eating some leftover snacks.

11
00:00:43.732 --> 00:00:47.253
He zipped over to Zann, chattering angrily and shooting flames.

12
00:00:47.273 --> 00:00:49.074
"Sorry, boy."

13
00:00:49.254 --> 00:00:50.474
Darb patted the dragon.

14
00:00:50.494 --> 00:00:52.455
"We didn't mean to leave you behind."

15
00:00:53.456 --> 00:00:57.417
Zann rubbed his fingers together and then pointed at some cups on the table.

16
00:00:57.838 --> 00:00:59.198
Poof! They disappeared.

17
00:01:00.239 --> 00:01:05.741
Perda and Gliss magically cleaned crumbs off the floor as Zann removed the decorations from the walls.

18
00:01:07.301 --> 00:01:08.762
Soon the house was clean.

19
00:01:10.602 --> 00:01:14.563
Remembering Ello's terrified face, Zann looked at his friends.

20
00:01:14.583 --> 00:01:16.644
"We have to help Ello."

21
00:01:17.584 --> 00:01:18.484
Gliss sat down.

22
00:01:18.505 --> 00:01:20.505
"Tell us what you saw, Zann."

23
00:01:21.485 --> 00:01:25.307
Zann described the mysterious Share as carefully as he could.

24
00:01:26.127 --> 00:01:30.068
By the time he was finished, his friends looked worried and confused.

25
00:01:31.216 --> 00:01:33.877
"Why would Ello still be trapped on Skellia?"

26
00:01:34.077 --> 00:01:34.658
Gliss said.

27
00:01:34.678 --> 00:01:39.360
"Wyssa promised to get the Skellian people to safety on another world."

28
00:01:39.380 --> 00:01:43.782
"But she was going to get rid of Morb first," Perda said.

29
00:01:43.802 --> 00:01:48.224
"Maybe he did something to her before she could save the Skellian people."

30
00:01:49.284 --> 00:01:50.264
Zann shook his head.

31
00:01:50.285 --> 00:01:51.285
"I doubt it.

32
00:01:52.065 --> 00:01:55.647
Wyssa is pretty strong, and Morb had no magic at all when they left."

33
00:01:55.667 --> 00:01:57.928
"Yeah," Gliss said.

34
00:01:58.348 --> 00:02:01.549
"But Wyssa was really angry and focused on Morb.

35
00:02:02.129 --> 00:02:04.190
Do you think she forgot about Skellia?"

36
00:02:04.210 --> 00:02:08.351
"Maybe we can contact her and ask," Darb suggested.

37
00:02:08.791 --> 00:02:10.912
He was sitting with Zing curled on his lap.

38
00:02:11.972 --> 00:02:13.312
Perda wrinkled her nose.

39
00:02:13.332 --> 00:02:14.733
"Contact her?

40
00:02:15.413 --> 00:02:18.654
How? She could be anywhere in the known worlds."

41
00:02:19.834 --> 00:02:22.135
"Or the unknown ones," Gliss said.

42
00:02:22.155 --> 00:02:25.896
"She seemed to know about worlds nobody else knew about."

43
00:02:27.228 --> 00:02:28.528
Zann felt impatient.

44
00:02:28.548 --> 00:02:30.269
"I think Ello's in trouble.

45
00:02:30.669 --> 00:02:33.770
We don't have time to try to track down Wyssa," he said.

46
00:02:33.790 --> 00:02:38.311
"That will take too long—especially if she doesn't want to be found."

47
00:02:38.331 --> 00:02:39.992
"Good point."

48
00:02:40.252 --> 00:02:40.912
Perda nodded.

49
00:02:40.932 --> 00:02:42.412
"So what should we do?"

50
00:02:44.673 --> 00:02:47.134
Zann paced back and forth across the room.

51
00:02:47.154 --> 00:02:48.714
"I'm not sure."

52
00:02:49.794 --> 00:02:51.035
Darb looked thoughtful.

53
00:02:51.055 --> 00:02:55.748
"I wonder how Ello got a mental message through to Zann.

54
00:02:55.768 --> 00:02:57.649
I thought the Skellians had weak magic.

55
00:02:58.049 --> 00:03:01.570
That's why they couldn't escape when the waters started rising, remember?"

56
00:03:01.590 --> 00:03:05.271
"It was because of the gulpers too," Perda said.

57
00:03:05.291 --> 00:03:08.192
"But never mind how Ello sent the message.

58
00:03:08.612 --> 00:03:11.392
The important thing is that he needs our help."

59
00:03:12.733 --> 00:03:13.953
Zann stopped pacing.

60
00:03:13.973 --> 00:03:18.915
"Maybe we can ask my parents to—" A crackle of magic interrupted him.

61
00:03:19.815 --> 00:03:23.936
Boz, Saffa, Teplo, and Zann's parents appeared in the room.

62
00:03:24.332 --> 00:03:25.933
They paid no attention to the kids.

63
00:03:25.953 --> 00:03:28.274
"What are we going to do?"

64
00:03:28.694 --> 00:03:29.835
Asta rubbed her head.

65
00:03:29.855 --> 00:03:32.356
"This is a disaster!"

66
00:03:32.557 --> 00:03:33.537
Teplo exclaimed.

67
00:03:34.498 --> 00:03:36.259
The other adults started talking too.

68
00:03:36.819 --> 00:03:39.120
Zann hurried over and tapped his dad's arm.

69
00:03:39.140 --> 00:03:43.002
"We have to tell you about something," Zann said.

70
00:03:43.022 --> 00:03:45.684
"Remember that weird Red Share I had?"

71
00:03:45.704 --> 00:03:49.906
"Not now, son," Nax said before Zann could continue.

72
00:03:49.926 --> 00:03:53.428
"We need to figure out how to deal with what the king and queen just did."

73
00:03:54.480 --> 00:03:57.561
Zann had almost forgotten about the king and queen's announcement.

74
00:03:57.581 --> 00:04:05.244
"Their resignation is effective immediately," Boz told the kids, shaking his head so hard that his long nose

75
00:04:05.344 --> 00:04:06.445
swayed back and forth.

76
00:04:06.465 --> 00:04:09.246
"And they've already gone into hiding."

77
00:04:10.387 --> 00:04:11.107
Saffa nodded.

78
00:04:11.127 --> 00:04:13.608
"They refuse to communicate with anyone."

79
00:04:14.628 --> 00:04:16.269
"That's weird," Perda said.

80
00:04:16.289 --> 00:04:19.210
"Yes." Teplo rubbed his chin.

81
00:04:19.230 --> 00:04:23.672
"Worse yet, there's been no final decision on how to handle the relics."

82
00:04:24.936 --> 00:04:28.558
"That's what the meeting was about earlier today," Asta told the kids.

83
00:04:29.679 --> 00:04:35.061
"The king and queen wanted us to stop cataloging the relics until a new vote takes place."

84
00:04:36.102 --> 00:04:38.503
"They didn't explain why," Saffa said.

85
00:04:38.523 --> 00:04:42.165
"Do you think they already knew then that they were going to resign tonight?"

86
00:04:43.426 --> 00:04:44.667
"Listen," Zann said.

87
00:04:44.687 --> 00:04:50.810
"You have to hear what I—" "Laddno isn't giving us much time to figure things out," Nax said

88
00:04:50.850 --> 00:04:51.650
to the other adults.

89
00:04:52.971 --> 00:04:54.632
"Laddno?" Perda chimed in.

90
00:04:55.040 --> 00:04:56.241
"How is he involved?"

91
00:04:57.082 --> 00:05:01.685
"He's already calling for an election to replace the king and queen," Teplo explained.

92
00:05:01.706 --> 00:05:07.490
"Lots of people seem to agree that it should happen as soon as possible," Asta added.

93
00:05:07.510 --> 00:05:12.334
"Many believe that the Red Council shouldn't be in charge of the election this time."

94
00:05:13.735 --> 00:05:15.316
"What?" Gliss blurted out.

95
00:05:15.336 --> 00:05:18.859
"But the Red Council always runs elections!"

96
00:05:20.040 --> 00:05:21.241
Zann was surprised.

97
00:05:21.261 --> 00:05:24.424
"Venna isn't going to like this," he said.

98
00:05:25.464 --> 00:05:28.566
"Venna has already announced her candidacy," Saffa told him.

99
00:05:29.126 --> 00:05:32.888
"She'll win easily, especially if nobody runs against her."

100
00:05:32.908 --> 00:05:35.670
"That's fine," Boz said.

101
00:05:35.690 --> 00:05:37.971
"We should start preparing to help her."

102
00:05:39.092 --> 00:05:40.753
Zann traded a look with his friends.

103
00:05:41.353 --> 00:05:42.834
This was all big news.

104
00:05:43.735 --> 00:05:45.155
But they could worry about it later.

105
00:05:45.696 --> 00:05:47.997
Right now they needed to help Ello.

106
00:05:48.017 --> 00:05:50.639
"Okay," he said to the adults.

107
00:05:50.659 --> 00:05:55.881
"But I was about to tell you—" Once again the room crackled with magic.

108
00:05:56.881 --> 00:06:01.463
This time Venna appeared, her face nearly as red as her hair.

109
00:06:01.483 --> 00:06:06.725
"You'll never believe who just announced he's running against me," she said.

110
00:06:06.745 --> 00:06:10.847
"Laddno!" All the adults gasped.

111
00:06:12.028 --> 00:06:13.428
"What?" Asta cried.

112
00:06:13.448 --> 00:06:17.050
"He's not the least bit qualified to lead Magica.

113
00:06:17.830 --> 00:06:19.831
He's never been involved in the government before.

114
00:06:20.351 --> 00:06:22.732
The only thing he's done is run a business."

115
00:06:24.072 --> 00:06:25.794
"I know," Venna said grimly.

116
00:06:25.814 --> 00:06:29.337
"I've already called an emergency meeting of the Council."

117
00:06:30.498 --> 00:06:31.719
"What are we waiting for?"

118
00:06:32.019 --> 00:06:33.580
Boz rubbed his fingers together.

119
00:06:33.600 --> 00:06:34.881
"Let's go!"

120
00:06:35.802 --> 00:06:39.365
Zap! "Now what are we going to do?"

121
00:06:39.705 --> 00:06:42.167
Zann said after the adults had all zapped away.

122
00:06:42.187 --> 00:06:43.769
"Ello needs our help!"

123
00:06:45.010 --> 00:06:45.810
Perda shrugged.

124
00:06:46.131 --> 00:06:46.751
"It's simple.

125
00:06:47.492 --> 00:06:52.036
If the adults can't help us rescue him, we'll just have to do it ourselves."
